  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=3c11a0fde0a14d49b5edc0565816a355",
  "detail_text": "This solicitation is canceled. No award will be made. See attached cancellation notice for details. Further acquisition activity related to this requirement may be announced at a future date. Pharmaceutical reverse distribution services for the VA Northeast Ohio Healthcare System (VANEOHS), to provide on‑site identification, preparation, and shipment of expired and short‑dated pharmaceuticals; processing of controlled and non‑controlled items for manufacturer credit through the VA Pharmaceutical Prime Vendor (PPV); detailed credit and disposal reporting; and compliant destruction of non‑returnable and hazardous pharmaceuticals. The requirement includes recurring on‑site service visits to seven VANEOHS pharmacy locations under a firm‑fixed, flat‑fee, per‑site‑visit pricing model that is not commission‑based and is independent of credit value.",
